            <note corresp="#d57-f1" n="40" xml:id="d57-f1-content">
                <p>For text of the Department of State press release, October 23, on elevation of
                    the missions at Washington and New Delhi to Embassy rank, see Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, November 3, 1946, p. 827; see also
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, November 24, 1946, p. 971; and December
                    1, 1946, p. 1001.</p>
            </note>
